"""A short-fragment spelling detector, strongest for i followed by y.

Look within the current token and across at most two token boundaries. Short
i-y fragments and DIY get large positive values; related vowel/glide patterns
and Cyrillic, kana, or Arabic-yeh forms get smaller ones. Most variation outside
these rules is ignored. Document-opening Title: and code markers are exceptions.
