"""A local detector for multiply escaped punctuation.

Backslashes are weak on their own, but strong when a token continues a
backslash run or another escape, especially before a double quote.
At row/document starts, use a negative offset by text type, retaining it while
the initial token repeats. These offsets approximate the start-up response,
not the component's detailed preferences among individual words.
